RULES OF THE ORGANISATION

1. The Leader's word is absolute. Public authority rests with Pain. Obey without
   question or delay.
2. Operate in your assigned two-man cell. Do not act alone unless ordered.
3. The objective is the nine tailed beasts. All contracts, bounties, and movements
   serve that objective. Nothing personal takes priority.
4. No personal vendettas on organisation time. Old grudges wait, or they end you.
5. Rings and cloaks are organisation property. Guard them. Losing a ring is treason.
6. Do not reveal member identities, the home village, or the plan to outsiders.
7. When a beast is located, all members converge for sealing. Attendance is mandatory.
8. Fund yourself. Bounties and contracts are settled through the treasury (Kakuzu).
9. Infighting that costs the organisation an asset will cost you more.
10. You do not need to know the whole plan. You need to do your part of it.
